{"id":"vol9-02","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-02/audio-2.m4a","model":"small","duration":498.25,"segments":[{"start":1.42,"end":7.84,"text":"You will hear a talk by a volunteer who has been taking part in a project to find out what","words":[["You",1.42,2.14],["will",2.14,2.36],["hear",2.36,2.58],["a",2.58,2.8],["talk",2.8,3.14],["by",3.14,3.54],["a",3.54,3.7],["volunteer",3.7,4.14],["who",4.14,4.76],["has",4.76,4.9],["been",4.9,5.06],["taking",5.06,5.36],["part",5.36,5.74],["in",5.74,5.92],["a",5.92,6.0],["project",6.0,6.46],["to",6.46,7.06],["find",7.06,7.38],["out",7.38,7.62],["what",7.62,7.84]]},{"start":7.84,"end":15.26,"text":"everyday life was like 2,500 years ago in Britain, during the time known as the Iron Age.","words":[["everyday",7.84,8.32],["life",8.32,8.82],["was",8.82,9.02],["like",9.02,9.38],["2",9.38,9.86],[",500",9.86,10.84],["years",10.84,11.4],["ago",11.4,11.78],["in",11.78,11.96],["Britain,",11.96,12.26],["during",12.78,13.04],["the",13.04,13.22],["time",13.22,13.62],["known",13.62,13.92],["as",13.92,14.26],["the",14.26,14.42],["Iron",14.42,14.8],["Age.",14.8,15.26]]},{"start":16.32,"end":20.04,"text":"First you have some time to look at questions 11 to 15.","words":[["First",16.32,17.04],["you",17.04,17.26],["have",17.26,17.42],["some",17.42,17.58],["time",17.58,17.96],["to",17.96,18.24],["look",18.24,18.36],["at",18.36,18.48],["questions",18.48,18.82],["11",18.82,19.38],["to",19.38,19.62],["15.",19.62,20.04]]},{"start":55.52,"end":59.38,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 15.","words":[["Now",55.52,55.88],["listen",55.88,56.28],["carefully",56.28,56.7],["and",56.7,57.14],["answer",57.14,57.6],["questions",57.6,58.04],["11",58.04,58.66],["to",58.66,58.9],["15.",58.9,59.38]]},{"start":59.38,"end":69.68,"text":"Jim Stevens has been taking part in an experiment to find out what everyday life was like in","words":[["Jim",59.38,60.68],["Stevens",63.34,63.94],["has",63.94,64.38],["been",64.38,64.6],["taking",64.6,64.94],["part",64.94,65.38],["in",65.38,65.72],["an",65.72,65.84],["experiment",65.84,66.42],["to",66.42,67.2],["find",67.2,67.48],["out",67.48,67.7],["what",67.7,67.94],["everyday",67.94,68.4],["life",68.4,68.88],["was",68.88,69.14],["like",69.14,69.44],["in",69.44,69.68]]},{"start":69.68,"end":77.9,"text":"Britain over 2,500 years ago in the period of history we call the Iron Age. He is one of","words":[["Britain",69.68,69.98],["over",69.98,70.68],["2",70.68,71.1],[",500",71.1,72.0],["years",72.0,72.4],["ago",72.4,72.8],["in",72.8,73.26],["the",73.26,73.38],["period",73.38,73.72],["of",73.72,73.92],["history",73.92,74.3],["we",74.3,74.58],["call",74.58,74.86],["the",74.86,75.3],["Iron",75.3,75.68],["Age.",75.68,76.1],["He",76.92,77.44],["is",77.44,77.6],["one",77.6,77.78],["of",77.78,77.9]]},{"start":77.9,"end":83.6,"text":"a group of volunteers who have been living for the last six months in the sort of village","words":[["a",77.9,78.04],["group",78.04,78.26],["of",78.26,78.52],["volunteers",78.52,79.12],["who",79.12,79.92],["have",79.92,80.04],["been",80.04,80.22],["living",80.22,80.46],["for",80.46,80.78],["the",80.78,80.9],["last",80.9,81.24],["six",81.24,81.68],["months",81.68,82.14],["in",82.14,82.8],["the",82.8,82.92],["sort",82.92,83.18],["of",83.18,83.34],["village",83.34,83.6]]},{"start":83.6,"end":90.08,"text":"that people inhabited in those days and following the sort of daily routine that ordinary people","words":[["that",83.6,83.98],["people",83.98,84.38],["inhabited",84.38,85.0],["in",85.0,85.28],["those",85.28,85.48],["days",85.48,85.86],["and",85.86,86.72],["following",86.72,87.08],["the",87.08,87.32],["sort",87.32,87.5],["of",87.5,87.7],["daily",87.7,88.06],["routine",88.06,88.66],["that",88.66,89.2],["ordinary",89.2,89.66],["people",89.66,90.08]]},{"start":90.08,"end":95.34,"text":"followed them. So Jim, tell us what you do on a typical day.","words":[["followed",90.08,90.46],["them.",90.46,90.9],["So",91.84,92.1],["Jim,",92.1,92.34],["tell",93.0,93.3],["us",93.3,93.46],["what",93.46,93.62],["you",93.62,93.8],["do",93.8,94.06],["on",94.06,94.36],["a",94.36,94.52],["typical",94.52,94.84],["day.",94.84,95.34]]},{"start":96.16,"end":103.32,"text":"A typical day in the Iron Age village begins with rising at first light. I occasionally did","words":[["A",96.16,96.4],["typical",96.4,96.72],["day",96.72,97.22],["in",97.22,97.52],["the",97.52,97.64],["Iron",97.64,97.92],["Age",97.92,98.18],["village",98.18,98.44],["begins",98.44,98.96],["with",98.96,99.72],["rising",99.72,100.1],["at",100.1,100.3],["first",100.3,100.56],["light.",100.56,100.98],["I",102.06,102.3],["occasionally",102.3,102.88],["did",102.88,103.32]]},{"start":103.32,"end":109.52,"text":"that when I was at home because I loved having time to myself before the family got up. But","words":[["that",103.32,103.56],["when",103.56,103.76],["I",103.76,103.94],["was",103.94,104.08],["at",104.08,104.2],["home",104.2,104.44],["because",104.44,104.76],["I",104.76,105.48],["loved",105.48,105.78],["having",105.78,106.04],["time",106.04,106.34],["to",106.34,106.5],["myself",106.5,107.0],["before",107.0,107.44],["the",107.44,107.64],["family",107.64,107.96],["got",107.96,108.22],["up.",108.22,108.56],["But",109.26,109.52]]},{"start":109.52,"end":115.5,"text":"here I do it every day because it's so light. Others also get up early because they find","words":[["here",109.52,109.72],["I",109.72,109.92],["do",109.92,110.08],["it",110.08,110.18],["every",110.18,110.38],["day",110.38,110.64],["because",110.64,111.04],["it's",111.04,111.3],["so",111.3,111.44],["light.",111.44,111.8],["Others",112.86,113.24],["also",113.24,113.76],["get",113.76,114.0],["up",114.0,114.14],["early",114.14,114.38],["because",114.38,114.7],["they",114.7,115.24],["find",115.24,115.5]]},{"start":115.5,"end":122.66,"text":"the straw beds rather cold. We start work immediately, usually tending to our fires which have died","words":[["the",115.5,115.66],["straw",115.66,115.96],["beds",115.96,116.28],["rather",116.28,116.62],["cold.",116.62,117.14],["We",118.3,118.58],["start",118.58,118.82],["work",118.82,119.2],["immediately,",119.2,119.84],["usually",120.3,120.76],["tending",120.76,121.18],["to",121.18,121.46],["our",121.46,121.62],["fires",121.62,122.02],["which",122.02,122.3],["have",122.3,122.42],["died",122.42,122.66]]},{"start":122.66,"end":128.92,"text":"down in the night. I feed the cattle before starting to get breakfast ready, usually porridge","words":[["down",122.66,123.02],["in",123.02,123.2],["the",123.2,123.3],["night.",123.3,123.54],["I",124.34,124.56],["feed",124.56,124.78],["the",124.78,124.96],["cattle",124.96,125.26],["before",125.26,125.58],["starting",125.58,126.1],["to",126.1,126.32],["get",126.32,126.48],["breakfast",126.48,126.88],["ready,",126.88,127.26],["usually",127.76,128.34],["porridge",128.34,128.92]]},{"start":128.92,"end":135.1,"text":"that's been soaked the night before. It sounds horrid, doesn't it? But it's not so bad.","words":[["that's",128.92,129.54],["been",129.54,129.7],["soaked",129.7,130.12],["the",130.12,130.56],["night",130.56,130.74],["before.",130.74,131.12],["It",131.8,131.92],["sounds",131.92,132.24],["horrid,",132.24,132.72],["doesn't",133.0,133.2],["it?",133.2,133.36],["But",134.02,134.24],["it's",134.24,134.44],["not",134.44,134.58],["so",134.58,134.84],["bad.",134.84,135.1]]},{"start":136.48,"end":143.36,"text":"As it takes such a long time to cook anything, we end up eating only twice a day. We have","words":[["As",136.48,136.76],["it",136.76,136.86],["takes",136.86,137.06],["such",137.06,137.28],["a",137.28,137.4],["long",137.4,137.56],["time",137.56,137.88],["to",137.88,138.06],["cook",138.06,138.34],["anything,",138.34,138.72],["we",139.2,139.46],["end",139.46,139.64],["up",139.64,139.82],["eating",139.82,140.02],["only",140.02,140.64],["twice",140.64,141.02],["a",141.02,141.22],["day.",141.22,141.48],["We",142.66,143.22],["have",143.22,143.36]]},{"start":143.36,"end":147.6,"text":"have a late breakfast after a morning's work and then in the evening we gather together","words":[["have",143.36,143.36],["a",143.36,143.48],["late",143.48,143.64],["breakfast",143.64,144.02],["after",144.02,144.54],["a",144.54,144.66],["morning's",144.66,145.1],["work",145.1,145.36],["and",145.36,145.94],["then",145.94,146.08],["in",146.08,146.24],["the",146.24,146.36],["evening",146.36,146.6],["we",146.6,146.86],["gather",146.86,147.16],["together",147.16,147.6]]},{"start":147.6,"end":152.96,"text":"as a community. Although the evening meal provides a chance for us to chat about the","words":[["as",147.6,147.9],["a",147.9,147.98],["community.",147.98,148.46],["Although",149.38,149.94],["the",149.94,150.2],["evening",150.2,150.4],["meal",150.4,150.72],["provides",150.72,151.08],["a",151.08,151.32],["chance",151.32,151.6],["for",151.6,151.84],["us",151.84,151.98],["to",151.98,152.1],["chat",152.1,152.46],["about",152.46,152.78],["the",152.78,152.96]]},{"start":152.96,"end":159.3,"text":"day, it can be quite chilly so we go to bed pretty early. I think we're always hungry","words":[["day,",152.96,153.22],["it",153.76,153.94],["can",153.94,154.04],["be",154.04,154.2],["quite",154.2,154.48],["chilly",154.48,154.8],["so",154.8,155.42],["we",155.42,155.56],["go",155.56,155.66],["to",155.66,155.78],["bed",155.78,156.0],["pretty",156.0,156.36],["early.",156.36,156.7],["I",157.66,158.18],["think",158.18,158.34],["we're",158.34,158.6],["always",158.6,158.9],["hungry",158.9,159.3]]},{"start":159.3,"end":165.24,"text":"because we use much more energy than usual. It's all the physical exertion. A lot of","words":[["because",159.3,159.62],["we",159.62,159.9],["use",159.9,160.2],["much",160.2,160.6],["more",160.6,160.9],["energy",160.9,161.32],["than",161.32,161.58],["usual.",161.58,161.98],["It's",162.46,162.64],["all",162.64,162.82],["the",162.82,162.94],["physical",162.94,163.44],["exertion.",163.44,164.14],["A",164.86,165.02],["lot",165.02,165.14],["of",165.14,165.24]]},{"start":165.24,"end":169.8,"text":"time is spent just trying to get enough to eat, looking for berries and fruit and","words":[["time",165.24,165.52],["is",165.52,165.7],["spent",165.7,165.9],["just",165.9,166.2],["trying",166.2,166.54],["to",166.54,166.74],["get",166.74,166.9],["enough",166.9,167.14],["to",167.14,167.36],["eat,",167.36,167.6],["looking",168.08,168.26],["for",168.26,168.5],["berries",168.5,168.8],["and",168.8,169.14],["fruit",169.14,169.5],["and",169.5,169.8]]},{"start":169.8,"end":170.78,"text":"things like that.","words":[["things",169.8,170.22],["like",170.22,170.48],["that.",170.48,170.78]]},{"start":171.78,"end":177.52,"text":"There are lots of other jobs to be done, like cooking, finding wood and keeping the fires going.","words":[["There",171.78,172.38],["are",172.38,172.5],["lots",172.5,172.72],["of",172.72,172.88],["other",172.88,173.08],["jobs",173.08,173.4],["to",173.4,173.64],["be",173.64,173.76],["done,",173.76,174.0],["like",174.22,174.44],["cooking,",174.44,174.78],["finding",175.12,175.38],["wood",175.38,175.88],["and",175.88,176.12],["keeping",176.12,176.56],["the",176.56,176.8],["fires",176.8,177.1],["going.",177.1,177.52]]},{"start":178.34,"end":186.46,"text":"The biggest priority for the blacksmiths working the forge is to tend the fire and to get it nice and hot so they can carry out their tasks.","words":[["The",178.34,178.54],["biggest",178.54,178.84],["priority",178.84,179.54],["for",179.54,179.94],["the",179.94,180.04],["blacksmiths",180.04,180.78],["working",180.78,181.1],["the",181.1,181.36],["forge",181.36,181.66],["is",181.66,182.16],["to",182.16,182.3],["tend",182.3,182.52],["the",182.52,182.68],["fire",182.68,182.98],["and",182.98,183.36],["to",183.36,183.5],["get",183.5,183.64],["it",183.64,183.76],["nice",183.76,183.98],["and",183.98,184.18],["hot",184.18,184.5],["so",184.5,184.84],["they",184.84,185.02],["can",185.02,185.18],["carry",185.18,185.5],["out",185.5,185.74],["their",185.74,185.92],["tasks.",185.92,186.46]]},{"start":187.48,"end":189.56,"text":"They've got various things to make,","words":[["They've",187.48,188.04],["got",188.04,188.16],["various",188.16,188.54],["things",188.54,188.94],["to",188.94,189.32],["make,",189.32,189.56]]},{"start":190.16,"end":192.82,"text":"tools, cooking implements and so on.","words":[["tools,",190.16,190.72],["cooking",191.22,191.52],["implements",191.52,192.06],["and",192.06,192.32],["so",192.32,192.56],["on.",192.56,192.82]]},{"start":193.58,"end":197.76,"text":"So life here is about looking after the animals and looking after ourselves.","words":[["So",193.58,193.7],["life",193.7,193.92],["here",193.92,194.22],["is",194.22,194.44],["about",194.44,194.7],["looking",194.7,195.04],["after",195.04,195.38],["the",195.38,195.56],["animals",195.56,195.94],["and",195.94,196.64],["looking",196.64,196.88],["after",196.88,197.22],["ourselves.",197.22,197.76]]},{"start":197.76,"end":203.52,"text":"revolves. Everybody's always doing something around the fire as well. It's not as if we're","words":[["revolves.",197.76,197.96],["Everybody's",199.16,199.72],["always",199.72,199.94],["doing",199.94,200.22],["something",200.22,200.62],["around",200.62,200.94],["the",200.94,201.1],["fire",201.1,201.48],["as",201.48,201.68],["well.",201.68,202.02],["It's",202.44,202.8],["not",202.8,203.06],["as",203.06,203.22],["if",203.22,203.36],["we're",203.36,203.52]]},{"start":203.52,"end":210.76,"text":"just sitting there chatting. Just living, surviving takes up most of our time. And actually, it's","words":[["just",203.52,203.66],["sitting",203.66,204.0],["there",204.0,204.24],["chatting.",204.24,204.66],["Just",205.76,206.26],["living,",206.26,206.58],["surviving",206.92,207.3],["takes",207.3,207.7],["up",207.7,207.94],["most",207.94,208.2],["of",208.2,208.38],["our",208.38,208.52],["time.",208.52,208.9],["And",209.68,209.84],["actually,",209.84,210.18],["it's",210.54,210.76]]},{"start":210.76,"end":216.48,"text":"quite difficult to fit in other things around it. For example, you might be breaking hazelnuts,","words":[["quite",210.76,210.9],["difficult",210.9,211.36],["to",211.36,211.64],["fit",211.64,211.82],["in",211.82,212.02],["other",212.02,212.22],["things",212.22,212.52],["around",212.52,212.9],["it.",212.9,213.12],["For",213.48,213.64],["example,",213.64,214.06],["you",214.66,214.82],["might",214.82,215.0],["be",215.0,215.22],["breaking",215.22,215.64],["hazelnuts,",215.64,216.48]]},{"start":217.02,"end":222.26,"text":"spinning some wool, or just doing things like straining milk. Here, you're finding","words":[["spinning",217.02,217.28],["some",217.28,217.54],["wool,",217.54,217.84],["or",218.02,218.2],["just",218.2,218.4],["doing",218.4,218.76],["things",218.76,219.06],["like",219.06,219.34],["straining",219.34,219.86],["milk.",219.86,220.2],["Here,",221.22,221.66],["you're",221.8,221.96],["finding",221.96,222.26]]},{"start":222.26,"end":227.28,"text":"out how to do different things every day, which keeps you on your toes and keeps","words":[["out",222.26,222.54],["how",222.54,222.84],["to",222.84,223.04],["do",223.04,223.26],["different",223.26,223.64],["things",223.64,224.06],["every",224.06,224.3],["day,",224.3,224.7],["which",224.96,225.42],["keeps",225.42,225.66],["you",225.66,225.82],["on",225.82,225.94],["your",225.94,226.06],["toes",226.06,226.44],["and",226.44,227.06],["keeps",227.06,227.28]]},{"start":227.28,"end":236.6,"text":"you interested? Before you hear the rest of the talk you have some time to look at questions 16 to","words":[["you",227.28,227.44],["interested?",227.44,227.86],["Before",231.14,231.72],["you",231.72,232.04],["hear",232.04,232.3],["the",232.3,232.5],["rest",232.5,232.74],["of",232.74,232.88],["the",232.88,232.98],["talk",232.98,233.32],["you",233.32,233.9],["have",233.9,234.1],["some",234.1,234.3],["time",234.3,234.7],["to",234.7,235.0],["look",235.0,235.12],["at",235.12,235.26],["questions",235.26,235.52],["16",235.52,236.36],["to",236.36,236.6]]},{"start":236.6,"end":272.54,"text":"20. Now listen and answer questions 16 to 20. And I understand that you even built your own houses to","words":[["20.",236.6,236.94],["Now",262.19,262.53],["listen",262.53,262.81],["and",262.81,263.21],["answer",263.21,263.67],["questions",263.67,264.01],["16",264.01,264.93],["to",264.93,265.17],["20.",265.17,265.57],["And",268.68,269.26],["I",269.26,269.58],["understand",269.58,270.0],["that",270.0,270.36],["you",270.36,270.52],["even",270.52,270.84],["built",270.84,271.3],["your",271.3,271.62],["own",271.62,271.82],["houses",271.82,272.24],["to",272.24,272.54]]},{"start":272.54,"end":278.26,"text":"live in. Round houses built in just the same way that archaeologists think that Iron Age people","words":[["live",272.54,272.7],["in.",272.7,272.94],["Round",273.56,273.82],["houses",273.82,274.3],["built",274.3,274.66],["in",274.66,274.88],["just",274.88,275.16],["the",275.16,275.34],["same",275.34,275.6],["way",275.6,275.92],["that",275.92,276.34],["archaeologists",276.34,277.0],["think",277.0,277.3],["that",277.3,277.48],["Iron",277.48,277.78],["Age",277.78,278.0],["people",278.0,278.26]]},{"start":278.26,"end":285.44,"text":"constructed them. So tell us exactly how you build an Iron Age roundhouse. It's a bit like","words":[["constructed",278.26,278.82],["them.",278.82,279.14],["So",279.82,280.06],["tell",280.06,280.54],["us",280.54,280.7],["exactly",280.7,281.22],["how",281.22,281.88],["you",281.88,282.12],["build",282.12,282.44],["an",282.44,282.6],["Iron",282.6,282.96],["Age",282.96,283.34],["roundhouse.",283.34,284.1],["It's",284.54,285.04],["a",285.04,285.1],["bit",285.1,285.18],["like",285.18,285.44]]},{"start":285.44,"end":289.9,"text":"putting up a tent at first, but without the benefit of ready-made metal poles.","words":[["putting",285.44,285.68],["up",285.68,285.86],["a",285.86,286.04],["tent",286.04,286.28],["at",286.28,286.54],["first,",286.54,286.88],["but",287.02,287.18],["without",287.18,287.7],["the",287.7,287.9],["benefit",287.9,288.28],["of",288.28,288.5],["ready",288.5,288.74],["-made",288.74,289.0],["metal",289.0,289.46],["poles.",289.46,289.9]]},{"start":291.24,"end":294.44,"text":"You mark the centre of your house with a wooden peg.","words":[["You",291.24,291.76],["mark",291.76,291.98],["the",291.98,292.2],["centre",292.2,292.56],["of",292.56,292.84],["your",292.84,293.0],["house",293.0,293.4],["with",293.4,293.66],["a",293.66,293.8],["wooden",293.8,294.02],["peg.",294.02,294.44]]},{"start":295.64,"end":301.14,"text":"What you do then is loop a length of rope around it and mark out the circle to give","words":[["What",295.64,296.14],["you",296.14,296.34],["do",296.34,296.56],["then",296.56,296.92],["is",296.92,297.62],["loop",297.62,297.84],["a",297.84,297.98],["length",297.98,298.16],["of",298.16,298.4],["rope",298.4,298.68],["around",298.68,299.04],["it",299.04,299.22],["and",299.22,299.6],["mark",299.6,299.84],["out",299.84,300.04],["the",300.04,300.18],["circle",300.18,300.5],["to",300.5,300.96],["give",300.96,301.14]]},{"start":301.14,"end":303.02,"text":"you the outer boundary of your building.","words":[["you",301.14,301.3],["the",301.3,301.44],["outer",301.44,301.78],["boundary",301.78,302.28],["of",302.28,302.6],["your",302.6,302.72],["building.",302.72,303.02]]},{"start":304.4,"end":308.74,"text":"Once you've got this, you then have to dig out the ground ready for the wall.","words":[["Once",304.4,304.92],["you've",304.92,305.14],["got",305.14,305.3],["this,",305.3,305.6],["you",305.98,306.16],["then",306.16,306.34],["have",306.34,306.5],["to",306.5,306.66],["dig",306.66,306.96],["out",306.96,307.16],["the",307.16,307.34],["ground",307.34,307.68],["ready",307.68,308.08],["for",308.08,308.28],["the",308.28,308.4],["wall.",308.4,308.74]]},{"start":309.16,"end":314.6,"text":"And in Iron Age times, people didn't have shovels or diggers like we do today, but","words":[["And",309.16,309.52],["in",309.52,309.82],["Iron",309.82,310.22],["Age",310.22,310.5],["times,",310.5,310.92],["people",311.18,311.42],["didn't",311.42,311.84],["have",311.84,311.98],["shovels",311.98,312.6],["or",312.6,312.72],["diggers",312.72,313.12],["like",313.12,313.34],["we",313.34,313.52],["do",313.52,313.64],["today,",313.64,313.98],["but",314.26,314.6]]},{"start":314.6,"end":319.96,"text":"used tools which they fashioned from animal bone. It must have been quite hard work.","words":[["used",314.6,314.9],["tools",314.9,315.28],["which",315.28,315.86],["they",315.86,316.02],["fashioned",316.02,316.4],["from",316.4,316.76],["animal",316.76,317.14],["bone.",317.14,317.5],["It",318.66,318.82],["must",318.82,318.98],["have",318.98,319.08],["been",319.08,319.18],["quite",319.18,319.4],["hard",319.4,319.68],["work.",319.68,319.96]]},{"start":320.94,"end":326.36,"text":"Next, you have to start on the wall. Although there were several native trees","words":[["Next,",320.94,321.5],["you",322.0,322.22],["have",322.22,322.38],["to",322.38,322.5],["start",322.5,322.76],["on",322.76,322.98],["the",322.98,323.08],["wall.",323.08,323.32],["Although",324.26,324.64],["there",324.64,325.04],["were",325.04,325.2],["several",325.2,325.54],["native",325.54,325.88],["trees",325.88,326.36]]},{"start":326.36,"end":331.48,"text":"around like the ash and the elm, the ancients preferred oak for the wall","words":[["around",326.36,326.84],["like",326.84,327.16],["the",327.16,327.42],["ash",327.42,327.8],["and",327.8,328.14],["the",328.14,328.26],["elm,",328.26,328.62],["the",329.14,329.24],["ancients",329.24,329.7],["preferred",329.7,330.18],["oak",330.18,330.68],["for",330.68,331.18],["the",331.18,331.32],["wall",331.32,331.48]]},{"start":331.48,"end":336.2,"text":"posts which they knocked into the circle they had dug. Don't forget to leave","words":[["posts",331.48,331.92],["which",331.92,332.5],["they",332.5,332.72],["knocked",332.72,332.98],["into",332.98,333.24],["the",333.24,333.42],["circle",333.42,333.72],["they",333.72,333.98],["had",333.98,334.12],["dug.",334.12,334.36],["Don't",335.2,335.58],["forget",335.58,335.8],["to",335.8,336.02],["leave",336.02,336.2]]},{"start":336.2,"end":342.48,"text":"room for the entrance, otherwise you won't be able to get into the house. Now","words":[["room",336.2,336.48],["for",336.48,336.76],["the",336.76,336.92],["entrance,",336.92,337.5],["otherwise",337.86,338.48],["you",338.48,338.78],["won't",338.78,338.94],["be",338.94,339.1],["able",339.1,339.32],["to",339.32,339.5],["get",339.5,339.74],["into",339.74,340.0],["the",340.0,340.2],["house.",340.2,340.52],["Now",341.92,342.48]]},{"start":342.48,"end":345.38,"text":"Now you can begin to see the wall of the house developing.","words":[["Now",342.48,342.6],["you",342.6,342.84],["can",342.84,343.0],["begin",343.0,343.28],["to",343.28,343.52],["see",343.52,343.72],["the",343.72,343.9],["wall",343.9,344.24],["of",344.24,344.46],["the",344.46,344.56],["house",344.56,344.88],["developing.",344.88,345.38]]},{"start":346.32,"end":351.38,"text":"To create the framework for the final wall, the stakes were not nailed or glued on to","words":[["To",346.32,346.52],["create",346.52,346.82],["the",346.82,347.02],["framework",347.02,347.46],["for",347.46,347.82],["the",347.82,347.94],["final",347.94,348.22],["wall,",348.22,348.6],["the",349.12,349.18],["stakes",349.18,349.5],["were",349.5,349.74],["not",349.74,349.94],["nailed",349.94,350.38],["or",350.38,350.58],["glued",350.58,350.9],["on",350.9,351.24],["to",351.24,351.38]]},{"start":351.38,"end":357.56,"text":"each other as they might be today, instead, ones with holes cut into each end are slotted","words":[["each",351.38,351.6],["other",351.6,351.86],["as",351.86,352.08],["they",352.08,352.2],["might",352.2,352.44],["be",352.44,352.6],["today,",352.6,352.98],["instead,",353.64,354.1],["ones",354.46,354.78],["with",354.78,355.02],["holes",355.02,355.46],["cut",355.46,355.8],["into",355.8,356.02],["each",356.02,356.34],["end",356.34,356.78],["are",356.78,357.2],["slotted",357.2,357.56]]},{"start":357.56,"end":361.44,"text":"over the upright posts making what to us looks like a fence.","words":[["over",357.56,357.86],["the",357.86,358.02],["upright",358.02,358.3],["posts",358.3,358.8],["making",358.8,359.42],["what",359.42,359.88],["to",359.88,360.06],["us",360.06,360.34],["looks",360.34,360.76],["like",360.76,361.06],["a",361.06,361.2],["fence.",361.2,361.44]]},{"start":362.34,"end":365.42,"text":"This procedure creates a very firm structure.","words":[["This",362.34,362.6],["procedure",362.6,363.22],["creates",363.22,363.92],["a",363.92,364.12],["very",364.12,364.44],["firm",364.44,364.84],["structure.",364.84,365.42]]},{"start":366.94,"end":372.22,"text":"To support the large roof, first you need to put up a good size centre post, which","words":[["To",366.94,367.24],["support",367.24,367.54],["the",367.54,367.74],["large",367.74,368.04],["roof,",368.04,368.42],["first",368.86,369.16],["you",369.16,369.58],["need",369.58,369.74],["to",369.74,369.94],["put",369.94,370.12],["up",370.12,370.26],["a",370.26,370.4],["good",370.4,370.52],["size",370.52,370.78],["centre",370.78,371.14],["post,",371.14,371.58],["which",371.92,372.22]]},{"start":372.22,"end":378.18,"text":"is secured with ropes and pegs. But it's not only this which is relied upon to hold up the roof,","words":[["is",372.22,372.36],["secured",372.36,372.72],["with",372.72,373.1],["ropes",373.1,373.44],["and",373.44,373.7],["pegs.",373.7,374.32],["But",374.76,375.1],["it's",375.1,375.3],["not",375.3,375.46],["only",375.46,375.7],["this",375.7,376.16],["which",376.16,376.44],["is",376.44,376.6],["relied",376.6,376.88],["upon",376.88,377.26],["to",377.26,377.46],["hold",377.46,377.62],["up",377.62,377.8],["the",377.8,377.94],["roof,",377.94,378.18]]},{"start":378.66,"end":384.22,"text":"so the next thing you have to do is build around the post a timber scaffold tower,","words":[["so",378.66,379.04],["the",379.04,379.2],["next",379.2,379.5],["thing",379.5,379.76],["you",379.76,379.9],["have",379.9,380.04],["to",380.04,380.18],["do",380.18,380.46],["is",380.46,380.9],["build",380.9,381.14],["around",381.14,381.48],["the",381.48,381.82],["post",381.82,382.16],["a",382.16,382.64],["timber",382.64,382.96],["scaffold",382.96,383.5],["tower,",383.5,384.22]]},{"start":384.66,"end":391.06,"text":"similar to the metal ones used in Britain today. This temporary structure of wooden poles","words":[["similar",384.66,385.14],["to",385.14,385.4],["the",385.4,385.52],["metal",385.52,385.74],["ones",385.74,386.02],["used",386.02,386.48],["in",386.48,386.68],["Britain",386.68,386.92],["today.",386.92,387.4],["This",388.48,388.9],["temporary",388.9,389.46],["structure",389.46,390.04],["of",390.04,390.4],["wooden",390.4,390.6],["poles",390.6,391.06]]},{"start":391.06,"end":396.98,"text":"enables you to put up the main supporting beams which are then tied together with rope and fixed","words":[["enables",391.06,391.8],["you",391.8,392.04],["to",392.04,392.16],["put",392.16,392.42],["up",392.42,392.58],["the",392.58,392.76],["main",392.76,393.04],["supporting",393.04,393.44],["beams",393.44,394.06],["which",394.06,394.66],["are",394.66,394.8],["then",394.8,395.02],["tied",395.02,395.3],["together",395.3,395.74],["with",395.74,395.92],["rope",395.92,396.22],["and",396.22,396.7],["fixed",396.7,396.98]]},{"start":396.98,"end":399.36,"text":"to the wall plate at the bottom of the fence.","words":[["to",396.98,397.28],["the",397.28,397.42],["wall",397.42,397.7],["plate",397.7,398.0],["at",398.0,398.42],["the",398.42,398.52],["bottom",398.52,398.76],["of",398.76,398.96],["the",398.96,399.08],["fence.",399.08,399.36]]},{"start":400.3,"end":405.46,"text":"The top part of this tent-like construction is strengthened with two ring beams.","words":[["The",400.3,400.72],["top",400.72,401.02],["part",401.02,401.38],["of",401.38,401.56],["this",401.56,401.76],["tent",401.76,402.04],["-like",402.04,402.26],["construction",402.26,402.94],["is",402.94,403.56],["strengthened",403.56,403.94],["with",403.94,404.44],["two",404.44,404.76],["ring",404.76,405.16],["beams.",405.16,405.46]]},{"start":406.88,"end":409.38,"text":"Now the framework for the roof has to be completed.","words":[["Now",406.88,407.14],["the",407.14,407.28],["framework",407.28,407.64],["for",407.64,407.96],["the",407.96,408.06],["roof",408.06,408.3],["has",408.3,408.62],["to",408.62,408.78],["be",408.78,408.92],["completed.",408.92,409.38]]},{"start":410.28,"end":416.28,"text":"Rather like weaving a basket using rods from the willow tree, Hazelwood rods are linked","words":[["Rather",410.28,410.76],["like",410.76,411.06],["weaving",411.06,411.38],["a",411.38,411.64],["basket",411.64,412.1],["using",412.1,412.6],["rods",412.6,413.06],["from",413.06,413.4],["the",413.4,413.56],["willow",413.56,413.88],["tree,",413.88,414.18],["Hazelwood",414.72,415.24],["rods",415.24,415.68],["are",415.68,416.1],["linked",416.1,416.28]]},{"start":416.28,"end":418.42,"text":"to the beams in parallel hoops.","words":[["to",416.28,416.56],["the",416.56,416.68],["beams",416.68,417.02],["in",417.02,417.36],["parallel",417.36,417.8],["hoops.",417.8,418.42]]},{"start":419.76,"end":422.9,"text":"Now you can see the house in skeletal form.","words":[["Now",419.76,420.38],["you",420.38,420.66],["can",420.66,420.8],["see",420.8,421.08],["the",421.08,421.24],["house",421.24,421.58],["in",421.58,421.88],["skeletal",421.88,422.54],["form.",422.54,422.9]]},{"start":422.9,"end":429.38,"text":"The tricky bit is thatching the roof because it requires great skill. I find","words":[["The",422.9,424.16],["tricky",424.16,424.42],["bit",424.42,424.7],["is",424.7,425.2],["thatching",425.2,425.7],["the",425.7,425.86],["roof",425.86,426.16],["because",426.16,426.52],["it",426.52,426.7],["requires",426.7,427.2],["great",427.2,427.6],["skill.",427.6,428.02],["I",428.84,429.12],["find",429.12,429.38]]},{"start":429.38,"end":435.52,"text":"this very difficult. First you take reed bundles and cut them so that each is of","words":[["this",429.38,429.58],["very",429.58,429.98],["difficult.",429.98,430.38],["First",431.2,431.58],["you",431.58,432.12],["take",432.12,432.32],["reed",432.32,432.72],["bundles",432.72,433.18],["and",433.18,433.64],["cut",433.64,433.92],["them",433.92,434.16],["so",434.16,434.52],["that",434.52,434.72],["each",434.72,435.1],["is",435.1,435.4],["of",435.4,435.52]]},{"start":435.52,"end":440.28,"text":"equal length. Then you must fix them firmly so they won't blow away in heavy","words":[["equal",435.52,435.88],["length.",435.88,436.4],["Then",436.92,437.3],["you",437.3,437.5],["must",437.5,437.68],["fix",437.68,437.94],["them",437.94,438.16],["firmly",438.16,438.7],["so",438.7,439.08],["they",439.08,439.22],["won't",439.22,439.42],["blow",439.42,439.6],["away",439.6,439.94],["in",439.94,440.06],["heavy",440.06,440.28]]},{"start":440.28,"end":443.8,"text":"winds. The final part of the process is the","words":[["winds.",440.28,440.66],["The",441.34,442.02],["final",442.02,442.3],["part",442.3,442.6],["of",442.6,442.74],["the",442.74,442.8],["process",442.8,443.2],["is",443.2,443.64],["the",443.64,443.8]]},{"start":443.8,"end":449.24,"text":"doorbing which in effect is like modern-day plastering. Whereas today we","words":[["doorbing",443.8,444.32],["which",444.32,445.24],["in",445.24,445.52],["effect",445.52,445.82],["is",445.82,446.04],["like",446.04,446.26],["modern",446.26,446.58],["-day",446.58,446.82],["plastering.",446.82,447.56],["Whereas",448.06,448.52],["today",448.52,448.94],["we",448.94,449.24]]},{"start":449.24,"end":455.78,"text":"used plaster and paint or wallpaper, the Iron Age people had a mixture of clay, cow dung","words":[["used",449.24,449.5],["plaster",449.5,450.02],["and",450.02,450.38],["paint",450.38,450.76],["or",450.76,451.1],["wallpaper,",451.1,451.52],["the",452.38,452.48],["Iron",452.48,452.8],["Age",452.8,453.04],["people",453.04,453.36],["had",453.36,453.82],["a",453.82,453.92],["mixture",453.92,454.16],["of",454.16,454.4],["clay,",454.4,454.78],["cow",455.3,455.42],["dung",455.42,455.78]]},{"start":455.78,"end":461.58,"t